### Rules used when scoring

- **Financial GL metrics** → Core **`GLMAST`** primary; FFIEC/UBPR for regulatory definitions and peers
- **Dating** → any reporting period (day, MTD, EOM, EOQ, YTD, YoY, custom) can be derived from dated fields / history
- **Synapsys** → CRM / householding (not bank GL); People attrition is CRM-officer proxy only
- **FFIEC** → usable with an MDRM codebook (columns are codes like `RCON7204`, not plain-English names)

